headline-text\"><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Dakhil Kharij, Registration 2026</strong></span></p>\n</div>\n</div></div>\n\n<div class=\"gb-grid-column gb-grid-column-860b2712\"><div class=\"gb-container gb-container-860b2712\">\n\n<h5 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-f2184b83 gb-headline-text\"><strong>Total Post</strong></h5>\n\n\n<div class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-4259c0c2 gb-headline-text\">NA</div>\n</div></div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<!-- SarkariResult -->\n\n\n<div style=\"text-align:center;\">\n<a href=\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.vinod.sarkarinaukri&amp;hl=en_IN\" class=\"apply-button\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Download SarkariResult App Now</a>\n    </div>\n    \n\n</div>\n\n\n\n<!-- SarkariResult -->\n\n\n\n\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-ec1f6e4c\">\n<h6 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-c7683bda gb-headline-text\">Bihar Dakhil Kharij, Registration Online 2026</h6>\n\n<div class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-60ccea19 gb-headline-text\"><table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 100%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; color: #ffffff; background-color: #000080;\"><strong>&nbsp;Check your Land Record&nbsp;</strong></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 100%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; color: #000000;\">Bihar Khasara, Khatauni, Bhunaksha, Land Map and More Online Verification</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 100%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #ffffff; background-color: #000080; font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>&nbsp;How To Check &amp; Verify Khasara, Khataun, Bhulekh&nbsp;</strong></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 100%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; color: #000000;\">To check or verify the online certificate, candidates must visit the important link provided in the section below.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; color: #000000;\">Once on the page, click on the verification link either Server I or Old Server II.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; color: #000000;\">Next, select the district where the land is located (e.g., Agra, Allahabad, Firozabad, Kanpur, Varanasi, etc.).</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; color: #000000;\">Then, choose or enter the Tehsil Name in the designated field.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; color: #000000;\">After that, enter the Village/Area Name in the given box.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; color: #000000;\">Finally, input your Khasara Number in the appropriate field.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; color: #000000;\">You will then be able to view and verify the land record and related details.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%; height: 54px;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr style=\"height: 27px;\">\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center; height: 27px;\"><span style=\"color: #800000; font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Join Our WhatsApp Channel</strong></span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center; height: 27px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong><a href=\"https://whatsapp.com/channel/0029VaAbQf01NCrYADMLt00L\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Follow Now</a></strong></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 27px;\">\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center; height: 27px;\"><span style=\"color: #800000; font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Join Our Telegram Channel</strong></span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center; height: 27px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong><a href=\"https://t.me/SarkariExam_info\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Follow Now</a></strong></span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n\n\n<h6 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-cbf2939c gb-headline-tex